Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:47.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]黄金之谷…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Val d'or...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:52.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黄金峡谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the valley of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:54.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国人不出现怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if the french don't show?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.93,0:01:55.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 他们会出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,they'll show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:57.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只不过姗姗来迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll just be fashionably late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:01:59.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 您看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty,look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:00.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:03.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}驻足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Au pas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:04.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您有何打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:07.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我单枪匹马过去会他们的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was to ride down alone and meet the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.93,0:02:09.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:11.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}万一他们要诱您过去 加害于您怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if they mean to lure you down there to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:14.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:16.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都要视死如归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On pain of death!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:18.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留守在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:47.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.99,0:03:04.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]欢迎来到法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bienvenue en france.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:08.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:09.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mais non.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:12.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是您先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:23.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得我的胡子如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you like my beard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看起来像法国人 您知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You almost look french,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:44.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位注意 各位注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hear ye! Hear ye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:46.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我 亨利 以上帝之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I,henry,by the grace of god,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:49.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身为英格兰 爱尔兰 及法国的国王 在此…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}king of england, ireland and france,do hereby-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:56.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有您在此 我无法冠此头衔 有张冠李戴之嫌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot be that while you are here, for I would be a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:04:01.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此次会议中 我只是英格兰国王亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}During this summit I am simply henry, king of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:12.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]为此我深表感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}J'apprie orment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我 则是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I am just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:20.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国及勃艮第的国王 弗朗西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}franis,king of france and burgundy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:35.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两位陛下 恳求您们手按圣经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesties,may I ask you each to place a hand upon the holy bible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:40.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在上帝以及聚集在此的诸位王公贵族面前发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and swear before god and these princes and lords here gathered,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:46.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们将真诚而圣洁的爱戴对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you will be true,virtuous, and loving to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I so swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:04:59.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Moi aussi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:01.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:29.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Princess mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:34.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请允许我想您介绍亨利-菲利普王子 也就是您未来的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may I introduce prince henri philippe, your future husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:51.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你就是法国的皇太子？- [法语]是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Are you the dauphin of france? -  Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:52.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我要吻你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I want to kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:58.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]妈妈 妈妈 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maman! Maman!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mon dieu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:04.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也要弄这么个玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have got to get one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得这个幻影之宫如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The palace of illusions. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让人难以置信 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's incredible,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:31.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过是涂漆的帆布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's only painted canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:33.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但酒是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But real wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:37.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯 别喝太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't drink too much of it charles!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:13.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为您准备了一份礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您让我无颜以对 皇兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You embarrass me,brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:42.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.97,0:07:47.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所能回赠您的只有这块馅饼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all I can give you in return is this pastry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:36.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]非常有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tramusant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:52.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在想什么 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you thinking,charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:54.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在想 既然我来到贵地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm thinking that,while I'm here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就应该入乡随俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should behave like the king of france.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:57.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就是说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:08:58.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:03.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也应该溜入伊甸园 欣然的招蜂引蝶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall slip readily into the gardens of others and drink water from many fountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看见那边的年轻女士了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you see that young woman over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身着紫色和金色礼服的那位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dressed in purple and gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:21.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她名叫玛丽-博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her name is mary boleyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你们大使的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the daughter of your ambassador,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:24.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旁边是她的姐姐安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with her sister anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:29.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我称玛丽为英国母驴 经常被我骑在跨下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I call mary my english mare because I ride her so often.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:34.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah!Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:36.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:21.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利国王今天注意到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King henry noticed you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:24.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要告诉安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must go and tell anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:40.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:46.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:15.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啦哩...啦哩...啦哩啦勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lo li lo lay lo li lo lay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:20.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}飞鹰盘旋 夺走了我的少女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the falcon hath borne my maid away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你叫什么名字 小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what's your name,boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:28.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·塔利斯 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas tallis,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:30.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}塔利斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tallis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:31.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好嗓子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:37.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要封赏你的歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take a sovereign for your song.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:39.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢您 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:52.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah,boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:54.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白金汉有什么动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of buckingham?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:58.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在我面前公然辱骂主教您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In my presence he has railed against your eminence,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:00.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说您是一个巫师 一个皮条客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}calling you a necromancer,a pimp,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:04.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}指责您利用邪恶的手段留住国王对您的欢心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}accusing you of using evil ways to maintain your hold over the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:07.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于国王 白金汉说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what did lord buckingham say about the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:10.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他跟我说 他更有资格继承王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He told me he has a greater claim to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:13.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说陛下从无继位的资格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that as his majesty has no male heirs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:17.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将来也非名正言顺 还说他白金汉将要夺取王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will have none,that he,buckingham, will succeed to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:20.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 他还曾经说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he also told me once
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:24.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要加快事态的发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he has considered bringing that eventuality forward more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:26.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以什么方式？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:29.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刺杀国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By assassinating his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能告诉我 做得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did well to come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:43.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我必须警告你 不要告诉任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I must warn you, say nothing of this to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:03.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您看见了吗 皇兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see that,brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:09.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大多数方面 我们法国人都胜过你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In most things,we french excel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:15.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有最出色的画家 音乐家和诗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have the greatest painters, the greatest musicians and the greatest poets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:19.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不得不提的是 大多数还住在我的宫廷 真是上帝的恩赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most of whom,by the way, live at my court,dieu merci.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:25.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最杰出的哲学家 工程师 建筑师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The greatest philosophical minds, engineers,architects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:29.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 我们还有最美的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And of course, we have the most beautiful women.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:32.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您无法否认 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You won't deny that,will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:36.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连我们的摔跤手都好过你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even our wrestlers are better than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.23,0:13:42.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:43.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:45.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说您确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确定你们所有的摔跤手都好过我们的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All your wrestlers are better than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:54.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您想证明一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you want to prove it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的意思是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:03.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要挑战您比赛摔跤 皇兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am challenging you to a wrestling match, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Non,david.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:06.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是个懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.31,0:14:07.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Merde!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:10.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以法国的荣誉为注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}French honour is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:11.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接受您的挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]我很乐意奉陪到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Parce que tel est notre bon plaisir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:17.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在就开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:18.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Groom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:24.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]那好 就开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alors commence!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:32.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:52.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两位陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesties...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:54.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:55.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比赛规则如下:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the rules are as follows:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:59.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先将对手摔倒在地者 即为胜利者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first man to throw his opponent to the ground shall be declared the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:01.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您同意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you content?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:02.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比赛开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then fight on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:17.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算下注在谁身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What bet will you lay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加油 亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go,henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:21.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两个国王 两个皇后 还有一个笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}2 kings,2 queens and a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁是笨蛋？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's the fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:24.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还不知道 但这儿满屋子都是笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know yet, but it's a full house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.85,0:15:26.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加油 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on,your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:37.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利会胜出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry's gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:39.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管发生什么 他也不会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever happens,he's not gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:41.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加油 亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go,henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:42.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.29,0:15:50.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:24.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要再来一局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want a re-match!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要再战一局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want a re-match!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:27.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您害怕了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:29.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您害怕同我再战一局？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you afraid of a re-match?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:31.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您说我害怕？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you calling me afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:32.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有什么好怕的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of what am I supposed to be afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:34.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's have it then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:38.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会签那份条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not going to sign the treaty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会签那份条约 你去告诉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not gonna sign it! Go and tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那好 如果您真的… - 去 转告他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Alright if that's what -  I said...go and tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:44.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.97,0:16:46.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您想让全世界都认为英格兰国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you want the world to think that the king of england
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:50.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是如此善变 庸俗 脾气暴躁 言而无信的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is easily changeable, shallow,intemperate, incapable of keeping his word
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.97,0:16:52.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我一定会去转告他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then of course,I will go tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反正 我不过是您卑微的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all, I am merely your majesty's humble servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:12.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:14.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:23.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听闻你很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.28,0:18:31.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在法国宫廷住了2年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been at the french court for 2 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:35.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:42.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你都学了什么法国礼仪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what french graces have you learned?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下您允许吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your majesty's permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:52.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:04.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在此 我恳求尊贵的英格兰国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now I ask his gracious majesty, the king of england,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:08.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诚挚的在此万邦和平条约上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to also sign,in good faith, the treaty of universal...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:10.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}签字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and perpetual peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:37.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伦敦 白厅宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whiteball palace london
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:18.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:39.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别再理那些法国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forget about the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:41.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后的侄子已经被推举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The queen's nephew's been elected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:45.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不止是西班牙国王查理五世 还是圣罗马帝国的皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now he's not only charles v,the king of spain, he's also the holy roman emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:52.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的疆域辽阔 富甲天下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His dominions are vast, his wealth extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.87,0:22:55.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却年轻的不过20岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he's only 20 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.27,0:23:05.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去安排和他在亚琛会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will make arrangements to visit him at aachen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.22,0:23:06.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你亲自去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:10.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相对于和法国人合作 还不如和他合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may suit us better to do business with him, than with the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:14.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:20.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 托马斯-博林阁下到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir thomas boleyn,your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:26.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 阁下大人 我… - 你对那场表演意下如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Your grace I -  what did you think of that performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:30.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我… - 别装傻 你并不蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  I... -  don't be stupid! You're not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.07,0:23:31.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是国王的那场表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king's performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:32.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在首脑会议上的表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the summit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:34.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有什么感想？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did it strike you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:36.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我个人方面 很想看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Personally,I would have wished to seen
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头顶英格兰皇冠者 是位更加伟大 更加神勇的男士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a greater more powerful man upon the throne of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.27,0:23:45.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}单凭出面就可让法国人起立叩拜之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone whose very presence would have made the french sit up and come to heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:50.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有意愿也有手段 犹如撵死惹人厌恶的蜘蛛一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have the way and the means to crush the usurper of my throne
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将那个夺我王位的篡位者退下台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as one would crush a revolting spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:23:56.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要他悔于登入教堂继位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will make him wish that he had entered the church after all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.74,0:24:00.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要他领悟到自己该将国家的事物交给天生王者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and left the affairs of the state to those who are born to rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.01,0:24:07.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你背叛我 博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you betray me boleyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:11.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会丢你的尸体喂狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll feed your body to my dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.52,0:24:19.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在说说看…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.39,0:24:22.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这里听到什么风声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what have you discovered here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.06,0:24:25.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确凿的消息证明…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have it on good authority...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.99,0:24:29.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白金汉公爵正在招兵买马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the duke of buckingham is raising an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.23,0:24:36.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说是为了在他不受欢迎的威尔士郡巡游而防身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He says it's to protect him while he tours his welsh estates where he's not popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.49,0:24:41.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还借了大量的款项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's also been borrowing large sums of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.67,0:24:46.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白金汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Buckingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.56,0:24:55.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以新年之名 邀他入宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Invite him to court,for the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.15,0:24:59.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不要打草惊蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But don't say anything to alarm him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:17.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的孩子们可好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are your children?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.89,0:25:20.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都很好 感谢您的关心 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're well,thank you,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.51,0:25:23.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我鼓励他们学习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I encourage them all at their studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.13,0:25:25.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包括女孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.98,0:25:27.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}果然是理想主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Always the idealist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.22,0:25:30.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想着 总有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At some point,I imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.60,0:25:33.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女孩受教育会成为毫不稀奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it will be considered ordinary enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.13,0:25:35.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分正常的一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and nothing strange for a girl to be educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.36,0:25:39.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我收到件礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've received a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.49,0:25:40.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乌尔比诺公爵送的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From the duke of urbino.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.31,0:25:44.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是本叫"君王论"的书 作者是佛罗伦萨的尼可洛-马基雅维里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a book called the prince, by a florentine,niccolo machiavelli.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:45.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道这本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.93,0:25:47.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是讲述政治时机的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's about political opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.64,0:25:51.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:54.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟你的书"乌托邦"不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's not like your book,utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.66,0:25:57.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有你的那么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's less...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:58.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乌托邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}utopian.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.73,0:26:05.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过他倒是提出了个重要的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless he asks an important question
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.96,0:26:08.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身为国王关键在于受人敬畏呢…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whether it is better for a king to be feared...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.02,0:26:10.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是受人爱戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.10,0:26:23.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白金汉想杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Buckingham is going to try and kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.31,0:26:40.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.87,0:26:42.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布朗特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady blount.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.00,0:26:46.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到产期了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are full term?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.01,0:26:48.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.26,0:26:51.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.08,0:26:53.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如您所想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As can be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:57.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下让您带口信了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you some message from his majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.59,0:26:58.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. None.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.43,0:27:01.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过你丈夫倒是有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But from your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.26,0:27:03.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.61,0:27:06.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我跟他谈过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,I have spoken to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.47,0:27:09.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He finds that he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:12.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以接受你的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}reconciled to your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.06,0:27:15.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不会把我送进修道院？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he won't send me to a nunnery?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.16,0:27:19.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将被赐伯爵头衔 并有领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will be made an earl and be given estates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.61,0:27:25.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我的孩子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my child?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.66,0:27:29.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是否认这个孩子只有国王本人能决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is for the king to decide whether he will recognize the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:33.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉我无法给你更多安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm afraid I can offer you no more comfort than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.54,0:27:41.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您能向国王转达我对他的爱吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you tell the king of my love for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.82,0:27:55.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白金汉领地 潘雪斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Buckingbam's Estate Pensburst
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.13,0:28:06.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}领主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.43,0:28:09.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在此宣誓效忠您及您的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I here by pledge my allegiance to you and your house
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:12.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发誓永远辅助您 至死不渝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and do swear to serve you,even unto death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.49,0:28:14.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从心底感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We thank you from the bottom of our heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.29,0:28:18.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事成之后 你们的忠诚将得到丰厚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in due course, you will find your loyalties richly
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.73,0:28:22.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恰当的奖赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and properly rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.19,0:28:32.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想应该告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I should tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.62,0:28:36.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被派去会见 神圣罗马帝国的新任皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am being sent to meet the new holy roman emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.98,0:28:40.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王令我拟一份新条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king has asked me to draw up a new treaty,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.61,0:28:43.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}联合两国对抗法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}uniting us against the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.90,0:28:49.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 您一定很失望 - 我很现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You must be very disappointed. - I am very realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:53.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我可失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I am disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.28,0:28:58.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我们的梦想十分不切实际 - 也许如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Our dreams were very unrealistic. - Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:00.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我会坚持下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I will continue to dream them
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.08,0:29:04.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}纵使我要独自前行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even if I am alone in doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.38,0:29:15.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕陛下不再…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear his majesty no longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:20.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像以前一般信任我 在乎我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}trusts or cares for me as he once did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.79,0:29:23.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 听我一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas,let me give you a little advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.26,0:29:27.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想要保有君王的宠爱 必须做的事情就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you want to keep the love of a prince,this is what you must do:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.21,0:29:32.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做好把你在这世上最珍视的东西 献给他的准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must be prepared to give him the thing you most care for in all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.83,0:29:37.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最珍视的是我的气节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thing I care for most is my integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.18,0:29:45.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教阁下您最珍视什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it you care for most in the world, your eminence?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.32,0:30:02.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为伟大的白金汉公爵让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way for the great duke of buckingham!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.31,0:30:08.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺福克公爵大人到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His grace,the duke of norfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.69,0:30:11.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.87,0:30:19.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}望陛下笑纳这简陋的新年礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope your majesty will accept this humble gift for the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.95,0:30:25.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我夫妇十分感谢大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are very grateful to your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.99,0:30:29.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的慷慨使我感激难言 一如既往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your generosity overwhelms me. As always.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.41,0:30:37.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}躺下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.31,0:30:40.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫仆人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get some minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.58,0:30:44.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白金汉公爵大人到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His grace,the duke of buckingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.24,0:31:07.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.88,0:31:10.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.44,0:31:17.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有句子… 雕刻在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It...has some words engraved on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:19.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.86,0:31:26.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"致此谦恭 真挚之心"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"With humble,true heart".
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.10,0:31:32.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分感激大人 你的话让我深受感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace overwhelms me. Your words touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.35,0:31:35.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这句话就是最好的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are the greatest gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.85,0:31:40.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比任何财富更有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Greater than any riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.09,0:32:01.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用力推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.29,0:32:03.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.16,0:32:05.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.08,0:32:31.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"致此谦恭 真挚之心"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"With true and humble heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.78,0:32:48.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.53,0:32:57.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人请停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold your grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.95,0:32:59.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.07,0:33:03.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人涉嫌叛国 需受拘捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace is arrested on suspicion of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.53,0:33:07.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奉国王之命 我要将您押送高塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am ordered by the king's majesty to take you to the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.25,0:33:10.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 听我一句劝 先生们 让我们过去 - 决不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You take my advice,gentlemen,you let us pass. - By no means.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.06,0:33:13.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若您身边任何一位随从反抗陛下仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if any of your men should strike against his majesty's servants
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.42,0:33:14.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即便是尽职之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in pursuit of their duties
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.38,0:33:19.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}均会被认为叛国 大人您应当清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that is treason too, as your grace should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.68,0:33:24.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.61,0:33:31.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们初出茅庐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are only new men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.65,0:33:32.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们什么都不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.93,0:33:35.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我被控告叛国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I'm accused of treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.46,0:33:39.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}审判我的会是我自己的同僚 而不是那屠夫的走狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should be judged by a jury of my peers,not by the dogs of butchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:42.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰没有一个王公贵族敢判我有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no lord in england who'll ever find against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.84,0:33:46.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}列队包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Form them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.36,0:34:02.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我设立了由高级官员组成的法庭 审判白金汉的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have instituted a court of high steward to judge buckingham's case.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:05.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}20名贵族将被指派上法庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}20 peers will be appointed to the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.82,0:34:08.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺福克将是第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Norfolk will be first among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.26,0:34:11.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 我能否… - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your majesty,if I may... - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.57,0:34:16.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信判公爵的叛国罪会带来危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe it could be dangerous to find the duke guilty of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.30,0:34:20.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 就算他真有罪？- 就算他真有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Even if he is? - Even if he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.45,0:34:25.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一方面 他可以被判轻一些的罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the other hand,he could be found guilty of some lesser offence
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.59,0:34:28.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}处以大量罚金 驱逐出庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}heavily fined and banished from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.33,0:34:31.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样他将会受尽羞辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In that way he would be disgraced
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.57,0:34:36.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他的友人同盟 就找不到反抗您的理由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but his friends and allies would have little cause or occasion to rise against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.93,0:34:39.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这会是最好的结果？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that would be the best outcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.72,0:34:42.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe it would,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.48,0:34:47.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会负责保证法庭做出此判决？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you would see to it that the court came to that decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.82,0:34:50.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对此信心十足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have every confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.49,0:34:54.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对阁下你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I have in your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.47,0:35:03.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}设立法庭的是沃尔西 领导法庭的是诺福克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey will set up the court. Norfolk will head it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.77,0:35:06.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你去提醒这位大人他的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to remind his grace of his responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.23,0:35:10.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}40-30 勇攀高峰啊 先生们 上啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}40-30! Chase to full,gentlemen.Bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.72,0:35:17.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛利？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.07,0:35:21.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王晚上还有召见你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does the king still call for you at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.90,0:35:27.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有了 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.10,0:35:38.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即便国王是你的教父 你走上前时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even though the king is your godfather when you approach him...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.25,0:35:43.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- your grace. - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.72,0:35:45.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是传达陛下的关爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to pass on his majesty's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.96,0:35:49.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对于您在白金汉大人审讯中 挺身而出独当一面表示感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He appreciates the role you will play at my lord buckingham's trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.16,0:35:52.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也感谢您平时对陛下的关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for all the care you have for his majesty's well being.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.84,0:35:55.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还要给您这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He also sends you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.65,0:36:11.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我父亲的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is my father's ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.61,0:36:16.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是被陛下的父亲处死的 你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was executed by his majesty's father,did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.87,0:36:20.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下觉得您应该会愿意戴上它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty thought you might like to wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:27.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这是令郎？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Is this your son? - Yes it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.38,0:36:31.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他正要去见他的教父 也就是国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is going to be received by his godfather. The king.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.45,0:36:37.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人应该多多关心您的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace should have a care for his inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.71,0:36:42.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您的举动使得他丧失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would be terrible,for example, if some action of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.12,0:36:48.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 头衔以及戒指的话 那就太可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were to deprive him of a father, a title and a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.02,0:36:53.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告辞了 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.46,0:37:22.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人被控叛国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace has been accused of treason
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.26,0:37:27.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}及预谋和策划刺杀国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and of imagining and plotting the death of the king's majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.39,0:37:32.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本庭的高级官员 在审查所有相关控诉您的证据之后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This court of high steward, after reviewing all the evidence against your grace...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.97,0:37:37.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们判定大人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}finds your grace...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.94,0:37:40.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有罪名成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}guilty of the charges against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.16,0:37:43.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.40,0:37:45.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.66,0:37:50.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据陛下旨意 处大人以死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sentences your grace to death, at his majesty's pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.38,0:37:52.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是你搞的鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is your doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.08,0:37:55.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这屠夫的走狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You butcher's dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.64,0:37:59.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全是… 你搞的鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all...your doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.54,0:38:07.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.83,0:39:02.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.61,0:39:27.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑您 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God bless you,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.69,0:39:31.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿上这个 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take this your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.73,0:40:25.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您原谅我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.98,0:40:31.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人请趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace must lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.75,0:40:55.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您伸开双臂 我便动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you stretch out your arms, I will strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.96,0:41:04.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请伸开双臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stretch out your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.78,0:41:32.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.81,0:41:36.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.03,0:41:40.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.66,0:41:44.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.69,0:41:56.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快点 懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.16,0:42:17.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a son!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.79,0:42:19.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈 哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ha!Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.17,0:42:24.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有儿子了 上帝 听到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a son,god! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.49,0:42:26.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a son!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.08,0:43:11.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真该为了如此幸事恭喜陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty is to be congratulated on such a happy event.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.91,0:43:13.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.94,0:43:16.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人在楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lady is upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.94,0:43:25.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 亨利 恭喜 - 谢谢 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Henry,congratulations. - Thank you charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.24,0:43:28.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就知道不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I always knew it wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.22,0:43:30.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.43,0:43:42.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下决定认下他的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty has decided to recognize his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.10,0:43:46.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}暂赐名亨利-菲茨罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will be known for the present as henry fitzroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.57,0:43:49.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将在达翰姆郡拥有自己的官邸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will have his own establishment at durham house,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.09,0:43:55.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一名牧师 一名将领以及扈从 与之身份地位相符\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a chaplain, officer and a retinue befitting his station.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.99,0:43:58.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.63,0:44:04.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该写信向陛下致谢 我只是遵照他的吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should write and thank his majesty. I only do his bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.85,0:44:14.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后驾到 王后驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The queen! The queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.76,0:44:53.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敬我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.33,0:45:11.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马 圣彼得大教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}St. Peter's Basilica Rome
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.99,0:45:24.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟沃尔西有什么协议？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was your deal with wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.52,0:45:28.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为英格兰不与法国开战的回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In return for england not going to war with france
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.14,0:45:31.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向他承诺 法国将投他一票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promised him the french vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.53,0:45:35.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 沃尔西已经去了亚琛 面见新皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fact is,wolsey has gone to aachen to meet the new emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.32,0:45:39.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很显然 他意图对你国毁约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He obviously means to break the treaty with your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.27,0:45:41.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样一来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.18,0:45:46.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我方便无义务履行承诺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we are no longer obliged to deliver our side of the bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.41,0:45:52.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿吾之圣人安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Corpus domini nostri jesu christi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.31,0:46:03.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何 我们不要英国教皇 已经有过一个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In any case,we don't want an english pope. We had one once.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.89,0:46:06.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个疯子 再也不要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was insane. Never again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.29,0:46:11.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇非意大利人不可 这是上帝的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The pope must be an italian. That is god's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.60,0:46:15.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 教皇宗座 您必须吞下 - 塞进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your holiness must swallow it. - Push it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.28,0:47:24.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仁慈的圣母 我向您祈祷 我恳求您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lady,full of grace, I pray you,I beseech you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.49,0:47:29.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对您和您的圣子耶稣基督 献上我所有谦卑的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In all humility for the love I bear for you and for your son jesus christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.73,0:47:31.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求您…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray you...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.92,0:47:34.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赐予我婴孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}give me a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.37,0:47:38.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个男孩 让我孕育之处不再空虚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A son to fill my empty womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.28,0:47:41.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求您…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.84,0:47:56.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几周后 朝廷会从白厅搬出 迁移至汉普顿王宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a few weeks the court will quit whitehall for hampton court.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.00,0:48:01.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}城中眼下汗热病肆虐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's been an incident of the sweating sickness in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.62,0:48:05.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也知道国王对疾病多么惧怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know how afraid the king is of any illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.22,0:48:07.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.97,0:48:21.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听说枢机主教奥尔西尼当选教皇 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was sorry to hear of cardinal orsinI's election as pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.00,0:48:24.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你永远都在抱歉 摩尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are perpetually sorry,more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.88,0:48:27.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不只是出于礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wasn't simply being polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.82,0:48:28.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.16,0:48:30.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.47,0:48:33.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要教会中 这种明目张胆的腐败 还存在一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As long as there is such blatant corruption in the church,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.95,0:48:36.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会不断有追随者 加入那异教徒路德的队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that heretic luther will continue to gain followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.20,0:48:40.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道若是阁下您当选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know that if your eminence had been elected,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.01,0:48:45.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您定会不知疲倦地净化教会 使之脱离邪恶之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you would have worked tirelessly to cleanse the church of all its evil practices.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.05,0:48:52.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许你视我过高 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you think too highly of me,thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.58,0:48:58.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也许将整个人类种族都视得过高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps,you think too highly of the whole human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.95,0:49:09.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布朗特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady blount.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.52,0:49:11.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. More.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.95,0:49:20.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.88,0:49:26.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.75,0:49:31.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.14,0:50:11.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舅舅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.89,0:50:12.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.36,0:50:33.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可爱的安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweet anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.98,0:50:34.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:36.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道为什么叫你来这儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know why you are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.64,0:50:37.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.25,0:50:39.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴黎没人告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In paris,no one explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.90,0:50:40.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.07,0:50:42.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.27,0:50:44.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.39,0:50:47.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下对他的法国盟友已然厌倦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty is tiring of his french alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.40,0:50:51.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎对你妹妹也已厌倦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems he is also tiring of your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.47,0:50:53.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不再邀请她上床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He no longer invites her to his bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.35,0:50:55.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.41,0:50:56.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们才可怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor us!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.55,0:51:00.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她做他情人的时候 我们积聚了所有财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When she was his mistress all our fortunes were made.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.30,0:51:02.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在很可能将要失去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now most likely they will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.50,0:51:06.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.94,0:51:15.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算他看上我一时 谁能保证他看上我一世？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even if he had me, who is to say he would keep me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.21,0:51:17.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不只玛丽一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not just mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.30,0:51:19.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人们说他所有的暧昧关系都不长久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say that all his liaisons are soon over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.12,0:51:22.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他摇摆不定 阴晴未卜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He blows hot,he blows cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.65,0:51:27.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你能想出什么方法 让他的兴趣更…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you could imagine a way to keep his interest more...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.75,0:51:30.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长久？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}prolonged?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.90,0:51:34.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我敢说你在法国学了不少吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I daresay you learned things in france?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.89,0:51:37.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎样使他神魂颠倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How to play his passions.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.28,0:51:42.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你蕴藏着危险而又让人深陷的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's something deep and dangerous in you,anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.68,0:51:47.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的双眼仿佛能勾人心魄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those eyes of yours are like dark hooks for the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.42,0:52:01.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟罗马皇帝的会面怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How was your meeting with the emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.36,0:52:02.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.26,0:52:03.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}颇有收获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.27,0:52:08.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他毫不掩饰对法国人的憎恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He makes no secret of his antipathy for the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.60,0:52:11.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想对法国开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants to go to war with them
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.19,0:52:15.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分急切想要与陛下结成同盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he is desperate for an alliance with your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.90,0:52:18.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为同盟的回报呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in return for our alliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:20.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对法国采取联合入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There will be a joint invasion of france
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.61,0:52:23.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}颠覆弗朗西斯国王的政权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the overthrow of king francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.99,0:52:26.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我便能登基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I shall claim the crown
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.54,0:52:32.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再次真正成为英格兰 爱尔兰以及法兰西的王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and once more truly be king of england,ireland,and france,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.74,0:52:34.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就跟我祖先一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just like my forefathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.17,0:52:41.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下你建造的宫殿是最华美的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence, has built the most beautiful palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.67,0:52:44.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.78,0:52:46.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很可能是英格兰最精美的房屋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Probably the finest house in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.39,0:52:50.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无之与其媲美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have nothing to compare with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.23,0:52:53.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再没有比这更美的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing to show more fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.42,0:53:02.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.38,0:53:07.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它是您的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.00,0:53:16.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连同陈设？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With the furnishings?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.19,0:53:29.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
